  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Integridade Publica Core Support 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected effects of the Project are 1) Strengthen democracy and promote integrity in politics; 2) Improve the CIP&apos;s intervention in the protection of public resources (financial, material, and environmental); 3) Develop community leadership against corruption; 4) Make the private sector more transparent and accountable and stop dirty money from flowing into the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
